6pt; font-size: 11pt; color: windowtext; font-family: Calibri; border-width: 0.5pt; border-color: windowtext; background: rgb(221, 235, 247);\">CBSE<\/td>\r\n  <td class=\"xl66\" width=\"135\" style=\"width: 101pt; font-size: 11pt; color: windowtext; font-family: Calibri; border-width: 0.5pt; border-color: windowtext; background: rgb(221, 235, 247);\">DR.\r\n  Jyoti Sharma , EDUCATION DIRECTOR CLUSTER INNOVATION CENTRE, DU<\/td>\r\n  <td class=\"xl73\" align=\"left\" width=\"255\" style=\"width: 191pt; font-size: 11pt; color: windowtext; font-family: Calibri; border-width: 0.5pt; border-color: windowtext; background: rgb(221, 235, 247);\">Competency-Based\r\n  Education (CBE) focuses on students mastering specific skills or competencies\r\n  at their own pace, emphasizing practical application over time-based\r\n  learning. Competency-Based Assessments (CBA) measure a student's ability to\r\n  solve real-world problems, ensuring they can apply knowledge effectively in\r\n  different scenarios.<\/td>\r\n <\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>","content_heading":null,"table_json_data":null,"accordion_json_data":null,"gallery_json_data":null,"section_type":"content","alignment":"left","background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#333333","padding_top":"50","padding_bottom":"50","content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null,"section_layout_id":null,"columns":[]}]}}